   "'classes' is the chain of hypernyms: class -> hypernym, null = root. Two",
   "levels only, on purpose: a deeper chain asks the model for a transitive",
   "step it does not have at this size.",
   "'negative_pool' lists the classes usable as a WRONG answer in the negatives",
   "step. Hypernyms are excluded: 'is the dog a thing?' has no clean no, while",
